cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software in your research, please cite it using the metadata below.
title: 'CAFA-TTA: Confidence-Aware Feature Alignment for Test-Time Adaptation in Cross-Domain Medical
  Image Classification'
type: software
authors:
- family-names: Lương
  given-names: Việt Anh
repository-code: https://github.com/dtc245200063-alt/CAFA-TTA
license: MIT
abstract: An experimental framework combining confidence-weighted entropy minimization and source-prototype
  feature alignment for unsupervised test-time adaptation in medical image classification. The framework
  is evaluated on PathMNIST and a selected external STARC-9 subset.
keywords:
- test-time adaptation
- medical image classification
- domain shift
- histopathology
- confidence weighting
- feature alignment
- source prototypes
- PathMNIST
- STARC-9
- deep learning
